\section{Centralized Algorithm for Online Sensor Selection}\label{sec:centralized}
Before developing the distributed algorithm for online sensor
selection, we will first review a centralized algorithm which is
guaranteed to achieve no $(1-1/e)$-regret.

Let $A$ be the set of sensors that activate in the current iteration of
the game, and let $\paymaxact{\ensuremath{v}} := \max \paren{\ensuremath{\pi}_{\ensuremath{v}'}
    : \ensuremath{v}' \in A \setminus \set{\ensuremath{v}}}$.

